# --- SECRETS & TOKENS — never commit (repo is public) ---
# These hold your Oura client_secret + access/refresh tokens.
oura_secrets.json
oura_tokens.json
# (also match them anywhere, just in case they move)
**/oura_secrets.json
**/oura_tokens.json

# --- logs ---
*.log
# 4 Aug 2026 — ROLLED logs are not covered by `*.log`: "thalamus.log.1" does not END
# in ".log". The audit's #10/#98 fixes (hidden_run.vbs + run_logged.cmd) both roll at
# 2 MB, so this pattern is now reachable. Same class as the .bak leak the E2E audit
# caught: a rule that stops one character short of the file it was written for.
*.log.[0-9]
*.log.[0-9][0-9]

